s, 'COMP SCI 1585');\" title=\"COMP SCI 1585\">COMP SCI 1585</a></td><td>Data Structures Laboratory</td><td class=\"hourscol\">1</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">A \"C\" or better grade in at least 9 credit hours of COMP SCI courses in addition to the above listed core courses, excluding:</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">COMP SCI 2001 - Domain Exploration and Innovation Methods</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">COMP SCI 3001 - Skill Development for Entrepreneurs and Innovators</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">COMP SCI 4001 - Advanced Domain Exploration and Innovation Methods</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">COMP SCI 4001 - Interpersonal Dynamics for Entrepreneurs and Innovators</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=COMP%20SCI%204700\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'COMP SCI 4700');\" title=\"COMP SCI 4700\">COMP SCI 4700</a></td><td>Intellectual Property For Computer Scientists</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even lastrow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">All COMP SCI x9xx courses</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\"></td></tr> </tbody></table> <p><span>At most 6 credit hours can be transfer credits and transfer classes must show a \"C\" or better grade.</span></p>\n</div>"
